		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event2_enemy_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>Ｅ『よし……　しゅうりょうだ……
テストは　ぶじに　せいこうした</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>Ｅ『よし……　終了だ……
テストは　無事に　成功した</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
